<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - WMC, Anaconda off on nickel price fall.</title>
<headline>RTRS - WMC, Anaconda off on nickel price fall.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Australian nickel miners fell in early trading on Tuesday, following the fall in the nickel price to a two-year low on the London Metal Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>At 10.45 a.m. (2345 GMT), WMC Ltd shares were 13 cents or 1.67 percent lower at A$7.65, while QNI Ltd was seven cents off at A$2.52.</p>
<p>Nickel mining hopeful Anaconda Nickel Ltd was one of the biggest fallers, down 26 cents or 5.83 percent at A$4.20.</p>
</text>
